# Dynamic Page Titles & Descriptions

We'll implement `generateMetadata` for the post detail page:

```jsx
export async function generateMetadata({ params }) {
  const post = await prisma.post.findUnique({ where: { slug: params.slug } });
  return {
    title: post.title,
    description: post.content.slice(0, 160),
    openGraph: {
      images: [post.image || '/default-og.jpg'],
    },
  };
}
```

This makes every post shareable with a custom image and description.

